# Core rules

**[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) is the single source of truth.** Follow it. Do not treat this file as a second project guide.

- **No secrets.** Never commit `.env`, API keys, or credentials. `NASA_API_KEY` and `DEMO_SAFE` exist only as environment names (see `.env.example`).
- **No photos, video, voices, or likenesses of under-18s.** Name team members by first name or nickname only — no phone, email, address, school name, or other personal data.
- **Cite sources.** Do not invent facts. Mark gaps **UNVERIFIED**. Keep this repository **private**. No hosting integrations. Do not force-push `main`.
- `?demo=1` makes zero network requests. Contract field changes need a row in `docs/contracts/CHANGES.md` and updated fixtures.
